Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:33:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] msdasql: rowset data path, accessors, column info for the
 data-source enumerator, session and command stubs

- shared row cache and accessor table (rowset.c): CreateAccessor/AddRefAccessor/GetBindings/ReleaseAccessor,
  GetNextRows, GetData (converted with the oledb32 IDataConvert), AddRefRows/ReleaseRows, RestartPosition
- ODBC result sets fetch rows with SQLFetch/SQLGetData into that cache
- data source enumerator rowset lists the registered ODBC data sources and exposes IColumnsInfo/IRowsetInfo
  (column layout taken from the conformance test)
- IColumnsInfo on commands, MapColumnIDs, IConvertType::CanConvert, ICommand::Cancel, ICommandWithParameters
  (SetParameterInfo/GetParameterInfo/MapParameterNames), IOpenRowset::OpenRowset for a table name,
  ISessionProperties, ITransaction Commit/Abort through SQLEndTran, IDBInitialize state

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

